{"title": "Exits before emotions", "type": "Trading mistake", "hooks": ["Stop hoping a losing trade comes back. Decide your exit first.", "Nobody tells you the hardest part of trading is you, not the chart.", "The chart was easy. Managing yourself is the hard part."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop hoping a losing trade comes back. Decide your exit first.", "text": "Hope is not an exit", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "Three emotional traps", "vo": "The hardest part isn't the chart. It's you. Fear sells the bottom. Fear of missing out buys the top. After a loss, revenge trades get bigger.", "items": [{"text": "Fear", "sub": "sells at the bottom", "icon": "down"}, {"text": "Fear of missing out", "sub": "buys the top", "icon": "up"}, {"text": "Revenge trading", "sub": "bigger, worse trades after a loss", "icon": "warn"}], "cues": [{"say": "Fear sells the bottom", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "Fear of missing out", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "revenge trades", "do": "item", "i": 2}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Holding and hoping", "vo": "Say you bought Pioneerbridge Labs. Then it closed below the 20-candle low, on strong volume.", "cues": [{"say": "the 20-candle low", "do": "line", "price": 7.04, "label": "20-candle low", "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "It kept going", "show": 90, "vo": "Hoping doesn't help. The breakdown was real. It never closed back inside, and finished at 6.10.", "cues": [{"say": "The breakdown was real", "do": "reveal", "to": 115}, {"say": "never closed back inside", "do": "shade", "from": 90, "to": 115, "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Decide exits before you enter", "vo": "The fix: decide your stop-loss and take-profit before you enter, when you're calm.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Feel losses with practice money", "vo": "Set both with a one-click bracket, and feel you